WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:15.920
was taken into a room full of women.

2
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.901
They were taking off their clothes and putting on thin robes.

3
00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:25.263
Women and girls were talking and laughing.

4
00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:31.989
to bathe," the woman said.

5
00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:35.571
"I just had a bath," said Mandy.

6
00:00:36.712 --> 00:00:39.034
But the woman ignored her and left.

7
00:00:40.174 --> 00:00:44.077
Mandy walked through a hallway and started looking around.

8
00:00:44.097 --> 00:00:46.939
"What is Vinnie doing?"

9
00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:48.600
Mandy wondered.

10
00:00:50.161 --> 00:00:52.603
Vinnie was also in the bathhouse.

11
00:00:53.884 --> 00:00:57.286
He was sitting in a large bathing pool with some men.

12
00:00:58.407 --> 00:00:59.668
No women were there.

13
00:01:00.964 --> 00:01:04.907
Some men were lying on tables getting rubbed with oil.

14
00:01:06.008 --> 00:01:07.609
Others were exercising.

15
00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.872
Most of the men just sat in the pool talking.

16
00:01:11.892 --> 00:01:19.157
"Ah, there is nothing like a hot bath," said a young man sitting next to Vinnie.

17
00:01:20.358 --> 00:01:22.179
Vinnie smiled nervously.

18
00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:26.042
He wasn't comfortable bathing with strangers.

19
00:01:26.062 --> 00:01:34.328
"Some say Asian baths are better," continued the young man, "but I say Roman baths are the best."

20
00:01:35.569 --> 00:01:36.910
"The best in the world!"

21
00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:38.451
someone said.

22
00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:40.313
Everyone cheered.

23
00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:45.236
in Rome!"

24
00:01:45.877 --> 00:01:46.718
thought Vinnie.

25
00:01:46.738 --> 00:01:50.280
"I'm Varius," said the young man.

26
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:54.724
"Hi," said Vinnie, introducing himself.

27
00:01:56.664 --> 00:02:00.406
Mandy kept her clothes on and walked through a doorway.

28
00:02:01.546 --> 00:02:04.067
It led her into a large steam room.

29
00:02:05.548 --> 00:02:09.989
Women were silently sitting on benches enjoying the warm room.

30
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:14.991
But two women were whispering, and Mandy could hear them.

31
00:02:15.011 --> 00:02:19.093
"It's all set," one of the women said.

32
00:02:19.113 --> 00:02:22.835
"The poison will be put into the horses' water."

33
00:02:22.855 --> 00:02:26.176
"How?" said the other woman.

34
00:02:27.672 --> 00:02:30.954
Mandy could not hear what the first woman said next.

35
00:02:30.974 --> 00:02:34.096
"Aquila will lose the race.

36
00:02:34.656 --> 00:02:36.257
Brutus will be the champion!"

37
00:02:36.938 --> 00:02:38.939
said the other woman excitedly.

38
00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.901
Mandy was very upset.

39
00:02:42.981 --> 00:02:45.263
Someone was going to poison horses!

40
00:02:46.503 --> 00:02:48.084
She had to find Vinnie.

41
00:02:50.626 --> 00:02:54.048
Vinnie was now outside the bathhouse with Varius.

42
00:02:55.392 --> 00:02:58.053
Suddenly, Mandy came running up to them.

43
00:02:58.073 --> 00:03:02.515
"I heard something in the bathhouse," she cried.

44
00:03:02.535 --> 00:03:06.137
"Calm down," said her brother.

45
00:03:07.377 --> 00:03:09.598
He introduced Mandy to Varius.

46
00:03:09.618 --> 00:03:12.079
"Why are you upset?"

47
00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:13.620
asked Varius.

48
00:03:15.041 --> 00:03:17.222
Mandy told them what she had heard.

49
00:03:17.242 --> 00:03:20.943
"Why would anyone poison horses?"

50
00:03:21.664 --> 00:03:22.344
she cried.

51
00:03:23.924 --> 00:03:26.685
"Are you certain you heard the names Aquila and Brutus?"

52
00:03:27.385 --> 00:03:28.365
Varius asked.

53
00:03:29.466 --> 00:03:30.326
Mandy nodded.

54
00:03:30.346 --> 00:03:32.266
"Who are they?"

55
00:03:32.967 --> 00:03:33.667
said Vinnie.

56
00:03:33.687 --> 00:03:38.708
"Aquila is the chariot-race champion," answered Varius.

57
00:03:38.728 --> 00:03:42.049
"Brutus hates Aquila because he cannot beat him.

58
00:03:42.889 --> 00:03:44.730
We must stop this wicked plan."

59
00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.390
"But how?"

60
00:03:47.011 --> 00:03:47.691
asked Vinnie.

61
00:03:47.711 --> 00:03:51.732
"Septimus will know what to do," said Varius.

62
00:03:53.196 --> 00:03:55.637
"He is a censor and my father's good friend."

63
00:03:55.657 --> 00:03:57.779
"A censor?"

64
00:03:58.399 --> 00:03:59.239
Mandy said.

65
00:03:59.259 --> 00:04:04.182
"A censor protects Roman citizens and makes sure they obey the law."

66
00:04:05.103 --> 00:04:07.484
"Do they protect horses too?"

67
00:04:08.204 --> 00:04:09.805
said Mandy, worried.

68
00:04:09.825 --> 00:04:13.607
"Yes, they do," smiled Varius.

69
00:04:14.688 --> 00:04:16.329
"Where do we find the censor?"

70
00:04:17.029 --> 00:04:17.750
asked Vinnie.

71
00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:21.492
"At the forum," Varius replied.
